---
description: Celery tasks rules (idempotency, reliability)
globs:
  - "Server/app/celery/**"
alwaysApply: false

# Celery Tasks

- Ensure tasks are idempotent and retry-safe; configure retry policies explicitly.
- Avoid long transactions; commit small units of work.
- Pass only serializable, minimal payloads; fetch heavy data inside the task.
